## Context

Ticket [[0887]] mentions a Viet Nam retirement marked `suspended`, but the
current `data/jetp/implementation-events.csv` has suspended rows only for
Indonesia: Singkarak floating solar and Cirebon 1 coal retirement. The author
chose on 2026-09-24 to leave Cirebon unmapped pending review. A suspended
retirement proposal does not by itself establish the coal plant's asset state.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Reconcile the ticket wording with the source line and country.
- [ ] Decide whether an asset-state term applies to Cirebon, with a cited
  line, date and reason; if no term applies, document that explicitly.
- [ ] Add any warranted crosswalk revision by supersession and verify the
  ledger and the served Glossary.
